"version 0.0.1\n\n// @vibe/compiler/entry/compiler/file_compile — the single-file (fs-rooted,\n// no external module closure) compile drivers: every `compile_file_fs_*`\n// mode variant (mvp/rc/coverage/trace/break/profiled) plus their cached\n// twins threaded through a TypeDb (ADR-0070 Phase 3, #897, compiler-internal\n// batch). Compiled into the compiler itself via compiler_sources_manifest.tsv\n// (group `entry`, dual-row: this contract + file_compile.vibe).\n//\n// The old index.vibe was not a facade but the whole implementation (the\n// package is single-file), so it moved verbatim to file_compile.vibe. No\n// exported types: `TypeDb` (from ../../../runtime) arrives as structural\n// signature text resolved against the implementation import when the facade\n// is merged in (normalize/perceus precedent — no re-import needed here). No\n// `version` binding existed (compiler-internal package).\n\nfn prepare_file_fs_cached(db: TypeDb, entry_path: String) -> TypeDb with { Error, Fs }\nfn check_file_fs_mode(entry_path: String) -> Int with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode(entry_path: String, entry_name: String, mode: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_rc(entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_rc_shadow(entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_testmeta(entry_path: String, entry_name: String, mode: String, meta_out: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_coverage(entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_trace(entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_break(entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_profiled(entry_path: String, entry_name: String, mode: String) -> (Bytes, Int, Int, Int, Int, Int, Int) with { Error, Fs, Profiler }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_cached(db: TypeDb, entry_path: String, entry_name: String, mode: String) -> (Bytes, TypeDb) with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_cached(db: TypeDb, entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> (Bytes, TypeDb) with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs(entry_path: String, entry_name: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_mode_cached_profiled(db: TypeDb, entry_path: String, entry_name: String, mode: String) -> (Bytes, TypeDb, Int, Int, Int, Int, Int, Int) with { Error, Fs, Profiler }\nfn compile_file_fs_module_cached(db: TypeDb, entry_path: String) -> (Bytes, TypeDb) with { Error, Fs }\nfn compile_file_fs_module(entry_path: String) -> Bytes with { Error, Fs }\n")
